Do not include hosts:, vars:, or any playbook-level headers. Only output valid task entries or blocks as expected in a role.  

Task 1: Import assert.yml
Description Task 1: Imports the assert.yml tasks file, running it only once on localhost.

Task 2: Pre-configure debian systems
Description Task 2: Pre-configures postfix on Debian systems using debconf, setting the mailer type to "No configuration".

Task 3: Install postfix
Description Task 3: Installs the postfix package.

Task 4: Install postfix-mysql
Description Task 4: Installs the postfix-mysql package if virtual mailbox maps or domains are configured to use mysql.

Task 5: Configure postfix (transport_maps)
Description Task 5: Configures the transport_maps file from a template, notifies handlers for validation and database rebuild, if the template is defined.

Task 6: Configure postfix (header_checks)
Description Task 6: Configures the header_checks file from a template, notifies handlers for validation and postfix reload, if the template is defined.

Task 7: Setting values for main.cf (1/2)
Description Task 7: Sets facts for use in the main.cf template, conditionally based on variable definitions.

Task 8: Setting values for main.cf (2/2)
Description Task 8: Sets more facts for use in the main.cf template, handling lists, strings, and default values.

Task 9: Configure postfix (main.cf)
Description Task 9: Configures the main.cf file from a template, validates the configuration, and notifies handlers for validation and postfix restart.

Task 10: Configure postfix (master.cf)
Description Task 10: Configures the master.cf file from a template, validates the configuration, and notifies handlers for validation and postfix restart.

Task 11: Creates cert/key directory
Description Task 11: Creates the directory for the TLS certificate and key if defined.

Task 12: Deploy Postfix TLS server certificate
Description Task 12: Deploys the TLS server certificate from a source file.

Task 13: Deploy Postfix TLS server key
Description Task 13: Deploys the TLS server key from a source file.

Task 14: Flush handlers
Description Task 14: Flushes all registered handlers.

Task 15: Configure aliases
Description Task 15: Configures postfix aliases from a list of aliases.

Task 16: Configure sender_access
Description Task 16: Configures the sender_access file with entries from a defined list.

Task 17: Configure recipient_access
Description Task 17: Configures the recipient_access file with entries from a defined list.

Task 18: Place sasl_password_map
Description Task 18: Creates or updates the sasl_password_map file with the provided content.

Task 19: Flush handlers again
Description Task 19: Flushes all registered handlers.

Task 20: Start and enable postfix
Description Task 20: Starts and enables the postfix service.


